;; data/datascript-tx.edn — the ANDI catalog. THIS FILE IS WHERE THE FACTS ARE
;; AUTHORED. Both readings under src/ are generated from it by
;; scripts/gen-kotoba-port.cljs; `nbb scripts/verify-catalog.cljs --live`
;; fetches every :url and requires every :source-quote to still be in it.
;;
;; Every entry carries the page it came from (:source-article) and the
;; verbatim span the claim rests on (:source-quote). Spans are quoted as the
;; page or PDF text reads after tags are stripped, entities decoded,
;; zero-width characters removed and whitespace collapsed -- which is what
;; the checker compares against. When the document dates itself in a span
;; that is not contiguous with the claim (a signature block, a closing line),
;; :date-quote carries that second span from the same document and the date
;; is checked against it.
;;
;; andi.com.co refuses non-browser clients: `/` answers 403 with a WAF page,
;; every other path drops the connection (measured 2026-09-11; July's note
;; recorded "socket hang up"). The first-party pages and documents are
;; therefore cited at the Internet Archive's capture of them, and the checker
;; verifies that each such URL wraps an andi.com.co original. The capture
;; timestamp is in the URL; :retrieved-at is when THIS catalog read it.
;;
;; No personal name of any office-holder is persisted here. The site's
;; presidency page, the statutes' signature block and Wikipedia's list of
;; presidents all carry names; they are cited only for what they say about
;; the institution.

[;; ---- founding, first-party, and the city settled ----
